                                "tr": "Fabrika geçen yıl eski modelin üretimini <w>durdurdu</w>.",
                                "es": "La fábrica <w>dejó de</w> producir el modelo antiguo el año pasado.",
                                "zh": "这家工厂去年<w>停止</w>了旧型号的生产。"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "The soldiers were ordered to <w>cease</w> fire immediately.",
